3. Repair: Look for `exit status 1`, `No such file`, or `prefix mismatch`.
   - Path Shims: `ln -sf <actual> <hallucinated>` (e.g., `ln -sf SPEC.md spec.md`).
   - Doctor: `gt doctor --fix` for git/beads repo health.
4. Nudge: `{{ cmd }} nudge <target> "Shim applied: <desc>"`.

